menu "Product Applications"

config OPENEMBER_APP_SMART_DEVICE_DEMO
    bool "Build product app: smart_device_demo"
    default n
    depends on OPENEMBER_ENABLE_LINK
    depends on OPENEMBER_ENABLE_MSGS
    help
      Build a small product-application entry point that initializes OpenEmber
      Link, creates a product node, and publishes openember-msgs NodeHeartbeat
      messages. Use it as a starting point for project-specific apps under
      apps/.

